VALUES
('The Seven Husbands of Evelyn Hugo', 'Taylor Jenkins Reid', 'A reclusive Hollywood icon, Evelyn Hugo, agrees to tell her life story to an unknown reporter. As she reveals her tumultuous life, love, and the truth behind her seven marriages, the reporter uncovers more than she ever imagined.', 13.49, 'Historical Fiction, Romance', 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pIEVU3EeL.jpg'),
('Circe', 'Madeline Miller', 'A modern retelling of the myth of Circe, the daughter of the sun god Helios. As she grows into her powers and interacts with gods, mortals, and mythological creatures, Circe faces love, betrayal, and transformation on her journey of self-discovery.', 12.99, 'Fantasy, Mythology', 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91c0yRVm+0L._UF1000,1000_QL80_.jpg');
